Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.28,0:01:59.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,According to Duanmu Ji,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.80,0:02:02.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,this should be the gate to the first trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:13.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have no way back...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:14.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can only move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come out !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:51.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, I'm here !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:53.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who do you want me to kill ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:54.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where are they ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:56.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,How many are there ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:09.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.20,0:03:11.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy !?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:13.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,You want me to go in there !?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.44,0:03:16.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who knows what's inside ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:17.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:19.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:21.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,At worst,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:22.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will just die here together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:32.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,A soul ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mustn't fall for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:40.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,W...wait !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.68,0:03:42.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll go in...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:46.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's yours when you come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.72,0:03:48.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Life is so unfair !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:13.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:15.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,the soul...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:20.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.20,0:04:21.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Metal...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.48,0:04:24.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems these trials are related to the 5 elements.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.24,0:04:26.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I only know the Earth Escape Technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:28.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only in the Earth trial
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.48,0:04:29.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,will I have an advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:36.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I should just go in a few more times
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:39.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,and properly fleece that fiend !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:41.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as I keep devouring souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.16,0:04:44.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to deal with him one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.44,0:04:48.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, another one ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:53.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:54.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:04:57.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your servant Xu Liguo is willing to serve you tirelessly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:04:59.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,through all dangers and hardships !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:13.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:18.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I already gave you all I had,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:20.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,you should've saved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:24.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:31.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is this thing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:35.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bastard, stop it !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:41.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll go, I'll go !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.80,0:05:52.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Found it !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:54.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,This fiend
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:05:56.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,is working me to death !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.64,0:05:58.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if I haven't done anything, I’m still working hard !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:09.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1677,524)\fad(300,300)}First Trial: Earth \NLand of the Ancient God
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.40,0:06:09.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,It looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:11.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,in order to clear this trial
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:12.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to reach that gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:22.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's coming...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.92,0:06:24.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the end !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:28.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I should have just fought him to the death !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.44,0:06:30.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I should've died like a man...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:32.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Earth Escape !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.72,0:06:39.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master's plan is brilliant !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.32,0:06:42.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the Earth Escape Technique in this Earth trial
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.68,0:06:44.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're like a fish in water !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:46.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're noisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:49.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, I'm not done !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.08,0:06:51.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Give me another soul !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:56.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Heavens bless me !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:59.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master is a living saint !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:07.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since we have the Earth Escape Technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.24,0:07:09.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,this Earth trial won't hurt me like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:12.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:13.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I braved all dangers
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.52,0:07:14.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,to find this place for you !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:15.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could I maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.92,0:07:17.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,get another reward ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.40,0:07:32.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is bad !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.16,0:08:01.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,This tornado
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.52,0:08:02.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,is made of beasts !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:08.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:17.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.24,0:08:29.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to shine !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come back !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:51.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're calling for backup !?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.60,0:08:53.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where is their honor ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:07.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're done for...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:09.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can't fight them !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:12.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can't run away...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:24.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,This black tower is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.16,0:09:27.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.44,0:09:29.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.08,0:09:34.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wh...What...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:35.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are you doing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.16,0:09:36.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're crazy !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:58.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.56,0:10:00.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's as I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.16,0:10:00.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This black tower
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:02.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,has a restriction to ward off the beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:18.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope this fiend gets trapped here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:20.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you die,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.36,0:10:22.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll devour you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:25.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xu Liguo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:29.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your servant is here !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:34.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,W...what ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:37.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is he smiling ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.68,0:10:39.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.32,0:10:41.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,is about to sacrifice me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:49.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Eat this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.04,0:10:50.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:55.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it really is
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.04,0:10:58.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,my last meal...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.88,0:11:02.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whatever !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:04.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die stuffed !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.04,0:11:06.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Try flying over that tornado.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.60,0:11:09.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't fly too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.02,0:11:15.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:18.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Watch me open a path
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.00,0:11:20.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,for you, Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.20,0:11:24.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I never would have thought
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.40,0:11:27.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,that you would set me free one day !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:44.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,So there's also a restriction in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.88,0:11:47.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a shame I lost my devil...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:11:58.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:01.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's a restriction in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:03.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,that prevents cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.52,0:12:04.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:05.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,when I was in the tornado
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.88,0:12:08.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I swallowed a bunch of these beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.20,0:12:10.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those beasts see me like mice see a cat,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:12.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,they didn't even try to fight !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:14.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Serves them right for bullying you !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:15.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Xu Liguo,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.64,0:12:17.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,have avenged you, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:20.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,They didn't attack you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:23.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean... A little bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:25.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,but for each hit I take, I devour 2 of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.12,0:12:28.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you devoured their souls
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.72,0:12:29.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,were they weak ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.88,0:12:31.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:35.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:39.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Individually, these beasts are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:42.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.52,0:12:45.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,if I tame a powerful one
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.04,0:12:48.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I should be able to control a tornado.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:51.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spit out half of the souls
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:53.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,you just devoured.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:54.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.32,0:13:05.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, I promise I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:07.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.20,0:13:22.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he doing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:34.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,As expected,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.40,0:13:36.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,these souls are all compatible with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:39.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're all copies of the same soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.20,0:13:41.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect material.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:44.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.52,0:13:47.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's creating a devil !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:48.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,No way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.00,0:13:50.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to quickly absorb
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:52.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,the 250 souls I devoured.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.68,0:13:54.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, if this new devil is stronger than me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.56,0:13:57.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,the fiend will surely feed me to him !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:13:58.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xu Liguo
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.24,0:13:59.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.00,0:14:01.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Catch more souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:03.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,300
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.44,0:14:05.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,300 ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:06.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.60,0:14:08.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll go...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.64,0:14:44.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.16,0:14:56.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,The weak group together
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.08,0:14:58.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,and eventually form a tornado.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:01.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The powerful beast I created
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.36,0:15:03.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,attracts weaker beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.52,0:15:05.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,to make a similar tornado.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.00,0:15:22.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Th...this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.20,0:15:24.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who did this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:35.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The tornado was poisoned to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.52,0:15:37.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the work of the Soul Formation poison cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:39.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hunchback Meng.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.24,0:16:06.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.76,0:16:08.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,The more I kill, the more come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.24,0:16:10.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tell me Li Tian,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.20,0:16:14.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,how about we have some fun together ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:37.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mere Core Formation and Nascent Soul beasts...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.60,0:16:40.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what if more of you are here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.20,0:16:52.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I haven't had this much fun killing in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.08,0:16:54.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keep coming !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.60,0:17:34.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Count the specks of time
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.48,0:17:34.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}floating down gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.84,0:17:40.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.84,0:17:48.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Forever lock away the scars
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:48.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}of this mortal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:54.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.40,0:18:02.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The flying bird could not escape the twilight
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.08,0:18:02.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.56,0:18:09.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}The night-blooming flower cannot drink
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.60,0:18:09.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.08,0:18:12.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I will ask the heavens who exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.16,0:18:16.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}sliced open this world
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:16.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}to let the rain fall in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.92,0:18:18.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I will refine the world
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.00,0:18:21.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}to make our palm lines say
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:23.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}that we will live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.80,0:18:26.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Walking off the beaten path
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.72,0:18:29.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}through heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.08,0:18:36.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Before returning to dust,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:36.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}I will refine this mortal body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.28,0:18:45.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}The left shore is the joyous laughter
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.16,0:18:45.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}that can brighten up a thousand years of sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.64,0:18:52.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The right shore is an eternal silence
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.24,0:18:52.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}lingering under the candlelight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:55.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}To overturn this fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.12,0:18:59.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I will walk against the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:06.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}I will even gather the clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.44,0:19:06.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}to illuminate the sky for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.04,0:19:10.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}All this sadness was not meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:14.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}How many lives and deaths\Nhave passed in the blink of an eye ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.20,0:19:20.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}I vow to break
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:20.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}this chess game of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.32,0:19:30.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,1500)}I vow to break
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:30.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,1500)}this chess game of fate.
